[QUEST1]
Nombre=Final Rest
Desc=I buried 13 children, 13 times I had to go to that place, but you have only one chance to get out alive on this mission, the cursed tombs are near the mausoleum of the Nix Cemetery
DescFinal=Today the Cemetery is calmer thanks to your strength. Take this noble adventurer, all the people of Nix thank you.
Repetible=1
RequiredLevel=13
PosMap=4
DescAudio=1048
DescFinalAudio=1049

[QUEST2]
Nombre=First steps in alchemy
Desc=Young worker, I need you to take this recipe that I gave you to my friend Caelum, so that she can teach you what you want to learn!
DescFinal=Good Luck!
Repetible=0
RequiredLevel=6
DescAudio=1050
DescFinalAudio=1051

[QUEST5]
Nombre=Your first hunt
Desc=Wild Wolves prowl our lands under the shadow of a sick moon. Weapons Master Bertram summons you: you must not only hunt them, but also pluck from one of them its cursed fang. Only a wolf, touched by darkness, bears it. Seek, wait... and listen for the distinct howl. The Wolf's Fang is not earned by luck, but by determination. Once you achieve it, visit me at Nix's Smithy.
DescFinal=Adventurer... You've done it! That fang doesn't come without courage. Talk to me again, I have a task for you.
Repetible=0
RequiredLevel=15
DescAudio=1054
DescFinalAudio=1055

[QUEST17]
Nombre=Between shadow and wound
Desc=Pay attention. The true bandit doesn't rely on strength, but on timing. In the Elven Forest, you'll have to move among creatures that can't be stopped by paralysis, learning to observe, attack, and disappear before you can be reached. Then you'll travel to New Hope, where the fairies punish recklessness with their dark magic and every mistake is costly. There, you must remain calm and maintain control in combat. If you master stealth in both places, you'll understand how to leave an opponent defenseless with the Disabling Strike.
DescFinal=You knew how to move unseen where the enemy couldn't be stopped and maintain control where others were immobilized. Now you understand that incapacitation isn't about strength: it's about precision and timing. From this moment on, the Incapacitating Strike is yours. Use it only when the shadow is on your side.
Repetible=0
RequiredLevel=25
PosMap=408
DescAudio=1066
DescFinalAudio=1067

[QUEST18]
Nombre=Fumigate time
Desc=I must return to my dear Nix, but these Giant and disgusting Spiders won't let me. Can you help me? I will reward you!
DescFinal=Thanks for your help!
Repetible=1
RequiredLevel=15
PosMap=38
DescAudio=1068
DescFinalAudio=1069

[QUEST28]
Nombre=Splinters of Blood and Wood
Desc=Listen carefully. Several maps away from Lindos lies the island of New Hope. It was once a fine place... until the ogres made it their lair. Those brutes know nothing of wood grain or craftsmanship, but the trees on that island grow nourished by a special soil. The wood absorbs the strength of the earth, and that's why their clubs don't splinter or break. I could work that wood like no one else, but I can't go looking for it alone. I need you to travel to New Hope, confront the ogres, and bring me proof that the path is clear. Kill 20 ogres and bring me 10 of their clubs. I don't care about the blood... I care about the grain. With that in my hands, Lindos will once again see works we thought were lost.
DescFinal=Well done! This is real wood. Look at these grains. Twisted, hard, full of dents... and yet they didn't break. Ogres think these clubs are only good for crushing skulls, but in the right hands they can become works worthy of Lindos.
Repetible=1
RequiredLevel=25
PosMap=408
DescAudio=1291
DescFinalAudio=1292

[QUEST29]
Nombre=Echoes of Ancient Antlers
Desc=Listen carefully, because I won't repeat myself. Elven wood isn't just ordinary timber. It's used to reinforce the ships of the Royal Navy and keep the kingdom's forges alive. Without it, the ports would be exposed, and enemies would soon appear. The problem is this cursed forest. My workers go in to chop it down, and they don't always return. Ancient Stags charge them without warning, tearing through armor like dry bark and leaving the camps in ruins. The Ents still watch from afar… but those stags are the forest's first warning. I need you to venture into the Elven Wood and bring them down a peg. Defeat 20 Ancient Stags and bring me 10 of their skulls. It's not cruelty: it's a message. When the forest understands that it can no longer claim the lives of Imperial workers, perhaps it will let us finish the job without further bloodshed.
DescFinal=These skulls weigh more than they look. The forest will feel their absence, I assure you. My men can now work a little more peacefully. Not safe… but alive, which is something.
Repetible=1
RequiredLevel=25
PosMap=65
DescAudio=1230
DescFinalAudio=1231

[QUEST30]
Nombre=Blodium's Picket Forge
Desc=You don't look like one of them. Listen, before this village froze in death, we came here for one thing: Blodium. A rare, blue mineral, as tough as the mountain itself. But it doesn't just fall to the ground. To pick it, you need a special tool, one I forged myself years ago: the Blodium Special Pickaxe. The original was lost, but I have the tools to make you a new one, if you help me clear a path so we can get out of here.
DescFinal=Perfect! With these skins I'll be able to survive the descent. Take the picket, a promise is a promise. I'm leaving now.
Repetible=1
RequiredLevel=25
PosMap=182
DescAudio=1504
DescFinalAudio=1505

[QUEST37]
Nombre=Ancestral magic
Desc=Within the Marabel Dungeon lies an animated entity so powerful that it owes its life to a magical component infused into it by the Witch Liches there, making it the Guardian of these infernal creatures. Our mages wish to study the enchantment that manipulates them. If you bring me a Curse Stone, you will be rewarded.
DescFinal=Excellent task! Finally our magicians will be able to explore that hidden power for so many years. Here is your reward!!
Repetible=1
RequiredLevel=20
PosMap=1
DescAudio=1092
DescFinalAudio=1093

[QUEST38]
Nombre=The adventure begins!
Desc=You have now reached level 13, congratulations! From now on, the adventure through the fantastic world of Argentum Online begins. My name is Heather, the person in charge of Fortune Island. Come in to receive some basic equipment... Try not to lose this so easily!
DescFinal=May luck be with you! In the Manual you will find all the answers you are looking for.
Repetible=0
RequiredLevel=13
DescAudio=1167
DescFinalAudio=1168

[QUEST39]
Nombre=Two types of wolves
Desc=There are two types of Wolves around here, whose skins can be very useful to some Tailor in the area.
DescFinal=Well done!
Repetible=0
RequiredLevel=14
PosMap=1
DescAudio=1094
DescFinalAudio=1095

[QUEST40]
Nombre=Road to Ullathorpe
Desc=I need to head to the trade city, but a group of Skeleton Aggressors destroyed the path and took control of the Gulf Beaches. If you can eliminate them and allow me to travel to Ullathorpe, I'll give you a handsome reward!
DescFinal=Have this, you deserve it.
Repetible=0
RequiredLevel=7
PosMap=508
DescAudio=1248
DescFinalAudio=1249

[QUEST41]
Nombre=Fangs of Fire
Desc=Orange snakes have begun appearing around Nix, and their venom is as fiery as their color. They're fast, aggressive, and attacking unwary travelers. Kill them before the trade route becomes impassable!
DescFinal=The citizens of Nix can rest easier knowing that this threat has been controlled, thank you adventurer.
Repetible=0
RequiredLevel=5
PosMap=35
DescAudio=1394
DescFinalAudio=1395

[QUEST42]
Nombre=A giant problem
Desc=As if the damned snakes were not enough, another creature has appeared east of Nix, and it is truly feared. Intense magic has changed the forest bats and made them very dangerous. Help us control the threat and I will give you a treasure.
DescFinal=There is something wrong in this forest, I can sense it. I have something to ask you, talk to me again adventurer
Repetible=0
RequiredLevel=8
PosMap=35

[QUEST44]
Nombre=The Lost Embryo
Desc=Listen carefully, for I have no time for dramatics... On an island south of here, the creatures I so protected—the noble Griffons—have fallen victim to an unexpected attack. Dark, swift, and voracious lizards have invaded their nests... but that's not the worst of it! One of these vile beasts escaped with a developing embryo, the first in an ancient line... If we don't recover it, the Golden Griffon bloodline will be lost forever. Travel to the island and eliminate all the lizards you find. One of them is carrying it inside her. Yes, literally... It has swallowed it whole. You'll recognize it when you see the unusual sheen on its belly.
DescFinal=I thought I'd never see one again... The Griffon bloodline will live on thanks to you! What? You found a Mysterious Card?
Repetible=0
RequiredLevel=15
DescAudio=1374
DescFinalAudio=1375

[QUEST45]
Nombre=The Swamp Threat
Desc=There's no need to enter the lair. The trolls and abominations are already emerging from the swamp. Swamp Wardens patrol this edge, awaiting the order to advance. If they cross this boundary, they'll march straight to Ullathorpe. Stay outside and eliminate as many as you can. We need to keep them contained here. When you've done your part, return to me. I'll reward you with gold and experience for each threat eliminated.
DescFinal=Well done. The advance has stalled... for now. As long as we keep them out of the lair, Ullathorpe will remain safe. Take your reward. Come back if you see them regrouping.
Repetible=1
RequiredLevel=18
PosMap=75
DescAudio=1184
DescFinalAudio=1185

[QUEST46]
Nombre=Iron Branded by Fire
Desc=Listen carefully. The iron in these mines has always been valuable, but now it's tainted with the magic of humanoid dragons. Apparently, those creatures used it to forge weapons and perform rituals. When they awoke, the vein began to corrupt. I need you to venture into the dragon dungeon and eliminate several of those bastards. Each one that falls will weaken their influence over the mine. If we don't stop them, soon there won't be any iron left... or any miners left alive.
DescFinal=I knew it... the iron cooled again. You've severed the link between the mine and those monsters. Take this. It's not much compared to what you saved us from, but it's a fair deal.
Repetible=1
RequiredLevel=20
PosMap=22
DescAudio=1186
DescFinalAudio=1187

[QUEST47]
Nombre=The Purge of Marabel
Desc=Listen carefully, adventurer. These crypts were once sacred, but now they are infested with brutal orcs and liches who dabble in forbidden arts. I need you to venture into the dungeon and reduce their numbers. Every creature that falls will weaken Marabel's dark power. Return to me when your task is complete, and I will reward you with gold and experience. As long as evil persists, there will always be work for someone with courage.
DescFinal=Good work. The blood spilled today will keep Marabel under control, for now. Here is your reward. Gold and experience, just as I promised. If you still have the strength, venture back into the crypt. Evil always returns.
Repetible=1
RequiredLevel=20
PosMap=70
DescAudio=1188
DescFinalAudio=1189

[QUEST48]
Nombre=The Captain's Sin
Desc=Years ago, I sailed these waters believing myself immortal—not out of bravery, but out of pride. I found an ancient reliquary among stolen loot, an artifact that promised calm seas and eternal winds. I ignored the warnings, ignored my crew, and activated it. The sea responded. Not with a storm, but with damnation. My ship was split, but not sunk. My people died, but did not depart. Their souls remain bound to those galleons you see now, forced to patrol the site of my sin. They attack anything that approaches because they still obey the last order I gave: defend the loot. Go south of Nix. Look at the hull of my half-sunken vessel and sink fifteen Ghost Galleons. Each one you destroy will break a link in the chain I forged myself. I seek not forgiveness… only that my sin cease to sail.
DescFinal=The sea grows calm... for a time. I feel some voices fading, others sinking deeper. It is not redemption you bring me, captain, only silence. My sin is not washed away; it returns with the tide. And when it does, those galleons will return... as always. But as long as you continue sinking them, my dead will rest a little longer.
Repetible=1
RequiredLevel=25
PosMap=211
DescAudio=1308
DescFinalAudio=1309

[QUEST56]
Nombre=New Minotaur Bosses
Desc=Since the arrival of the Minotaurs, iron mining has become a nightmare. We need to clear the area until we reach the depths of the Mine. If you manage to defeat the Minotaurs and bring back their horns as a sample, you will be rewarded by the guild.
DescFinal=Take these gold coins as a reward for your bravery!
Repetible=1
RequiredLevel=18
PosMap=369
DescAudio=1236
DescFinalAudio=1237

[QUEST58]
Nombre=LEGEND ON THE KEY
Desc=Listen carefully, noble warrior: There is an ancient rumor that spiders here drop a mysterious key when they die. Can you look into it for me?
DescFinal=You've done it! With this key you can access the next level within these Catacombs. I wish you the best success in your adventure within Argentum Online, remember to always be a good person!
Repetible=0
RequiredLevel=15
DescAudio=1098
DescFinalAudio=1099

[QUEST63]
Nombre=Plag of creatures
Desc=I never thought that living so close to the desert would turn into this drama. I have already tried everything possible to keep these creatures from coming near my cabin, but to no avail. Can you help me get out?
DescFinal=I will always remember your name!
Repetible=1
RequiredLevel=13
PosMap=82
DescAudio=1102
DescFinalAudio=1103

[QUEST64]
Nombre=Forestry
Desc=Don't be scared with me, I won't hurt you. Have you never seen someone with a green complexion? We are not many orcs here on the mainland but there is always a first time. I liked this location to build my house, it guarantees me some security to be close to the city of the King, but the tigers that lurk around here do not understand laws. If you clear the area a little and get the Scroll, I will give you a reward that will help you, you don't look very agile...
DescFinal=This is luxurious for me. Have what was promised.
Repetible=0
RequiredLevel=20
PosMap=194
DescAudio=1244
DescFinalAudio=1245

[QUEST65]
Nombre=Brute force
Desc=I don't know what you do here, it's not a place to wander. You look very cunning and capable, but from afar I can notice that your arms lack vigor. We can come to an agreement to offer you that bit that is missing in you. As you could see in the surroundings there are several bears. I alone cannot guarantee the safety of the area, help me by defeating several bears, if you get the Scroll of Strength, you will receive a brutal reward!
DescFinal=Good job, this will be of great help for your training.
Repetible=0
RequiredLevel=18
PosMap=25
DescAudio=1246
DescFinalAudio=1247

[QUEST66]
Nombre=Legionary Shield
Desc=Legionario, ho osservato i tuoi sforzi in nome della Legione Oscura. Non tutti possiedono la disciplina e la forza d'animo necessarie per portare i nostri emblemi, ma tu potresti essere l'eccezione. Se riuscirai a raccogliere 10 Distintivi Rossi, trofei conquistati in combattimento, torna da me. In cambio, ti concederò uno Scudo della Legione, forgiato per coloro che hanno dimostrato vera lealtà e resilienza. Ricorda, questo onore non è per tutti. Solo Cacciatori, Lavoratori, Bardi, Assassini e Banditi possono aspirare a portare questo simbolo della nostra forza. Vai, legionario. Dimostra di esserne degno.
Repetible=1
RequiredLevel=23
PosMap=295
DescAudio=1104

[QUEST68]
Nombre=Royal Shield
Desc=Soldier, your service to the Royal Navy has not gone unnoticed. Discipline and honor are the pillars that sustain us... and you have shown yourself to understand their value. Gather 10 Blue Badges and report to me. In return, you will be awarded a Navy Shield, worthy of those who protect order and the crown. This recognition is reserved only for Warriors, Workers, Paladins, and Clerics serving in the Navy. Fulfill your duty, and you will be rewarded accordingly.
Repetible=1
RequiredLevel=23
PosMap=294
DescAudio=1302

[QUEST80]
Nombre=Fragmented Grace
Desc=I was waiting for you, disciple. What many see as mere creatures... are not. Each one carries a fragment of an essence that was once pure... whole. Centuries ago, that light was shattered. Since then, its pieces have wandered apart... incomplete. Some tried to restore it. None succeeded. If you choose to follow this path, there will be no guidance, no shortcuts. Only fragments... scattered... waiting to be reunited. When all is reunited, return to me.
DescFinal=The essence responds to your call... and takes shape again. Not everyone understands what you just did... but I do. Don't forget: even the Light... can shatter again.
Repetible=0
RequiredLevel=29
DescAudio=1182
DescFinalAudio=1183

[QUEST81]
Nombre=Dark Legion Shield
Desc=I can forge a shield for you, worthy of such a dark warrior.
Repetible=0
RequiredLevel=37

[QUEST94]
Nombre=Royal Shield
Desc=Soldier, your service to the Royal Navy has not gone unnoticed. Discipline and honor are the pillars that sustain us... and you have shown yourself to understand their value. Collect 10 Blue Badges and report to me. In return, you will be awarded a Navy Shield, worthy of those who protect order and the crown. This recognition is reserved only for Hunters, Workers, Bards, Bandits, and Assassins in service to the Navy. Do your duty, and you will be rewarded accordingly.
Repetible=1
RequiredLevel=23
PosMap=294
DescAudio=1303

[QUEST99]
Nombre=Need for Leader
Desc=We have lost track of time, countless moons have passed since we crossed the entrance to this cursed labyrinth. Shadows stalk us, whispers in ancient languages ??creep through the halls, and the stench of decay fills the air. If you are the beacon in this darkness, defeat the Wandering Skeletons and guide us out of this hell before we are a part of it.
DescFinal=We are safe, you proved to be a true leader!
Repetible=1
RequiredLevel=18
DescAudio=1370
DescFinalAudio=1371

[QUEST101]
Nombre=Full Moon
Desc=¡Mis respetos a tí, nadie lo habia logrado aún!
DescFinal=My respects to you, no one has done it yet!
RequiredLevel=16
PosMap=151
DescAudio=1420
DescFinalAudio=1421

[QUEST105]
Nombre=Legionary Shield
Desc=Legionnaire, I have observed your efforts in the name of the Dark Legion. Not all possess the discipline and fortitude to bear our emblems, but you could be the exception. If you can gather 10 Red Badges, trophies won in combat, return to me. In return, I will grant you a Legion Shield, forged for those who have demonstrated true loyalty and resilience. Remember, this honor is not for just anyone. Only Warriors, Workers, Paladins, and Clerics can aspire to bear this symbol of our strength. Go, legionnaire. Prove yourself worthy.
Repetible=1
RequiredLevel=23
PosMap=295
DescAudio=1297

[QUEST109]
Nombre=Har Nareth .. mythology?
Desc=Legend has it that an immense beast lives within the drainage, which terrifies the depths of this Castle. Are you able to obtain information? You should complete some missions for me, I can reward you very well!
DescFinal=Great job, but we must continue... Restore your equipment and talk to me again!
Repetible=0
RequiredLevel=16
DescAudio=1274
DescFinalAudio=1275

[QUEST116]
Nombre=Damn Murderers
Desc=I need to ask you a favor. I'm trying to head north, but the road is filled with these ruthless assassins who won't leave me alone. If you can clear the path, I can offer you a great reward.
DescFinal=This is for you, thank you for your work!
Repetible=0
RequiredLevel=9
PosMap=501
DescAudio=1250
DescFinalAudio=1251

[QUEST118]
Nombre=Magical Horde
Desc=It seems a horde of little Goblins with great magical powers has invaded our forest, attacking the Kingdom's merchants. Eliminate them and you will be well rewarded!
DescFinal=With these potions you can continue training!
Repetible=0
RequiredLevel=9
PosMap=185
DescAudio=1252
DescFinalAudio=1253

[QUEST123]
Nombre=Mysterious Message
Desc=Have you managed to catch a mysterious bottle? Don't open it! I can offer you a great reward if you fulfill my fish order. Don't tell anyone about this!
DescFinal=If you ever catch a bottle again, don't hesitate to come back!
Repetible=1
RequiredLevel=16
PosMap=254

[QUEST132]
Nombre=Farm on alert
Desc=We have suffered a terrible invasion of orcs on our beloved farm, all our crops are about to be lost. Can you help us?
DescFinal=For the moment that's enough, but stay hanging around here, maybe I'll need your help later.
Repetible=0
RequiredLevel=6
PosMap=188
DescAudio=1514
DescFinalAudio=1515

[QUEST137]
Nombre=Hunt for the Eye Watchers
Desc=The howling north wind brings with it a dangerous threat: the "Eyewardens," vigilant creatures with eyes like eagles who patrol the dark and dangerous lairs in the mountains. I ask you, brave adventurer, to venture into this dangerous territory to eliminate 30 of these relentless monsters and obtain 5 eagle feathers as proof of your feat.
DescFinal=You can feel closer to improvement, like a true polar traveler!
Repetible=1
RequiredLevel=29
PosMap=354
DescAudio=1240
DescFinalAudio=1241

[QUEST139]
Nombre=Winter strength
Desc=Welcome to this Snowy City! The cold here can kill you, you should always wear Winter Clothing to avoid suffering. If you manage to bring me 2 Gorilla Furs, I will give you one of these essential clothes for the area!
DescFinal=You have been very brave, with this you will be able to last a long time here!
Repetible=1
RequiredLevel=25
PosMap=354
DescAudio=1242
DescFinalAudio=1243

[QUEST140]
Nombre=The skill of the Eyewarden
Desc=Your agility is impressive, but I can help you improve your magic. Near the Village of Eleuria, more precisely inside the Glacier Cave, you can find the Arctic Eyewarden, a creature whose dexterity is incredible. Bring the scroll and I will help you translate it to improve your spell.
DescFinal=I thought you wouldn't make it! Now dexterity is part of your body.
Repetible=0
RequiredLevel=30
PosMap=354
DescAudio=1410
DescFinalAudio=1411

[QUEST141]
Nombre=The strength of Kadru
Desc=Your strength is admirable, but I can teach you how to improve your magic. Enter the Cave of the Nagas and show me your courage before the Kadrus that inhabit it, their strength demonstrates an opportunity to support our battle against darkness. Bring the scroll and I will help you translate it to improve your spell.
DescFinal=You have proven that the strength within you is enough to learn this spell, take this scroll, the shadows will fear your presence.
Repetible=0
RequiredLevel=28
PosMap=123
DescAudio=1412
DescFinalAudio=1413

[QUEST142]
Nombre=The last Light
Desc=Oh Cleric! The light has brought you to me. Are you ready to learn one of the strongest healings of our kind? The sorceresses have usurped one of our sacred scrolls, finish them off, bring the scroll back and I will teach you the true healing power of the Light.
DescFinal=Congratulations! With this spell you can heal even the deepest wounds. May the Light continue on your path!
Repetible=0
RequiredLevel=26
PosMap=214
DescAudio=1204
DescFinalAudio=1205

[QUEST153]
Nombre=The Underground Challenge
Desc=The city's basements and drains are infested. You must eliminate a number of black and gray rats from your house, and venture to the drains where the Giant Rat rules, eliminating several of these dangerous specimens. This challenge requires patience, perseverance and skill, since only those who keep their subscription active will be able to progress each day. Upon completing this test, the reward will be unique and lasting: a special mount that will allow you to travel around the city with the strength of these creatures.
DescFinal=You have demonstrated perseverance and courage in the face of underground threats. Your perseverance and skill have not gone unnoticed. Have this Mount as recognition of your effort and dedication!
Repetible=1
DescAudio=1106
DescFinalAudio=1107

[QUEST154]
Nombre=The seal of the Sun
Desc=The jade you carry is no mere stone. Each fragment you gathered was destined to remain separate, guarded by the ancient guardians of the Pyramid. Scarabs carved by hands that no longer exist still wander among the sands and tombs, carrying fragments of forgotten stories. By assembling these pieces, the puzzle was brought back to life, and with it, an energy the desert itself recognizes. It is a power that belongs neither to the living nor the dead: it can illuminate the mind, open hidden pathways, or awaken forces that should remain dormant. Whoever possesses the complete jade holds a link to secrets the sun and sand have guarded since ancient times. On its own, it can be unpredictable... but if given form, it can protect, reveal the hidden, or even guide those who are worthy. Now, that power can take shape. There is a mantle waiting for one who has been worthy to complete the work. Black as the desert night, golden as the light of its sun... a relic of a time when the ancient walked among the living. Give me the complete jade. Only then can the Mantle of the Fallen Sun be yours, and your participation in this ritual will be sealed forever.
DescFinal=Remember: the desert watches, and the secrets of the Fallen Sun are not revealed twice. May your path be marked by your courage and your wisdom.
Repetible=0
RequiredLevel=18
DescAudio=1262
DescFinalAudio=1263

[QUEST155]
Nombre=The Jade Puzzle
Desc=True jade doesn't break... it shatters to hide. In the Pyramid, the sands don't just cover tombs. They also conceal works that should never have been desecrated. There are creatures down there that don't attack out of instinct, but because of the burden they've carried since time immemorial. Scarabs carved by the ancients still walk among the ruined passageways, guardians of something they never understood. If fate is kind to you, the pieces will be reunited. And when that happens, the jade will speak for itself.
DescFinal=Each fragment bears the mark of the desert, but together they recapture the pulse of eternity. For years I believed this work was lost forever. The ancients were wise to separate it. My hands only do what the jade demands. It does not belong to me. Take it. The puzzle is complete. May its power be with you.
Repetible=0
RequiredLevel=18
PosMap=1
DescAudio=1165
DescFinalAudio=1166

[QUEST156]
Nombre=The Necklace of the Nameless King
Desc=I see the desert reflected in your eyes... you know what it's like to walk through cursed sands. Many years ago, a priceless necklace was buried alongside an unnamed king, deep within the Pyramid. It's not gold or silver that makes it special, but the curse that binds it to the dead. The mummies that wander there find no rest... one of them still wears the Ancient Necklace hanging from its withered neck. You must venture into the Pyramid and defeat mummies until you find it. There's no way of knowing which one wears it... the desert chooses. Bring me that necklace, and perhaps, just perhaps, we can unravel even more ancient secrets.
DescFinal=The mummies guarded it not out of loyalty, but as a curse. This object confirms my fears: the Pyramid still conceals fragments of an ancient power. You have done a great service, adventurer. Not everyone returns from there alive... and even fewer with a relic.
Repetible=1
RequiredLevel=18
PosMap=17
DescAudio=1264
DescFinalAudio=1265

[QUEST160]
Nombre=Secrets of the Eternal Desert
Desc=The necromantic energies emanating from the Mausoleum have guided us to the ancient Pyramid. There, among the sands and echoes of the past, lie Mummies imbued with a power far older than any known magic. Defeat the Mummies and search them for a Magic Note; you will also need the Egyptian Necklace worn by the sorcerer Kairo. Bring both items to me, and I will teach you a forgotten art: the power to Summon Mummies.
DescFinal=You've unraveled the secrets of ancient Egyptian necromancy. Your Summon Skeleton Warrior spell has been replaced with Summon Mummies, a power worthy of the ancient pharaohs!
Repetible=0
RequiredLevel=22
PosMap=16
DescAudio=1206
DescFinalAudio=1207

[QUEST161]
Nombre=Bless!
Desc=If you bring me a Reliquary, I can bless it for some gold coins.
DescFinal=Your Reliquary was Blessed!
Repetible=1
RequiredLevel=23
DescAudio=1115
DescFinalAudio=1116

[QUEST165]
Nombre=Special suit
Desc=To enter the Cave of the Nagas, south of here, you will have to get a very Special costume... I can make one for you, if you get a particular tunic for me!
DescFinal=Good job, here's your reward.
Repetible=1
RequiredLevel=27
PosMap=557
DescAudio=1516
DescFinalAudio=1517

[QUEST166]
Nombre=Clear the entrance
Desc=Hello, young adventurer, I need your help! That damned Laican has stolen the belongings of the inhabitants of Arghal, with your help we can recover everything! But first, clear the entrance, please!
DescFinal=Thank you very much! Have a little of this, it's the last thing I have left...
Repetible=0
RequiredLevel=7
PosMap=418
DescAudio=1254
DescFinalAudio=1255

[QUEST169]
Nombre=Help to return
Desc=I have spent a long time without returning to my beloved Ullathorpe, but now that I have found you, I need your help. Leaving this village to the south, the path is full of Scorpions, make your way through them to free the area .
DescFinal=You have survived! You have the strength necessary to help me accomplish my mission.
Repetible=1
RequiredLevel=13
PosMap=17
DescAudio=1266
DescFinalAudio=1267

[QUEST170]
Nombre=Pyramid near the
Desc=From here you can see the Pyramid, near it you will come across two very powerful magical creatures, defeat them to secure the northern exit of this village.
DescFinal=Amazing! We can now leave this Village safely.
Repetible=0
RequiredLevel=16

[QUEST171]
Nombre=Final effort
Desc=Now that the exits of this village are clear, all that remains is to encourage us to leave the Desert. We must be careful with the spiders.
DescFinal=Your help has been fundamental, I will be grateful to you for life.
Repetible=0
RequiredLevel=17

[QUEST172]
Nombre=Under the North Winds
Desc=The ancient mages of the Threshold never finished the Mauve Flash. It was unstable, dangerous... and they abandoned it. But the eternal cold of the Frost Giants is capable of shaping it. That is why they have awakened, and that is why the skies have been corrupted. If you confront this source of power, the spell will grow with you. Go to the outskirts of Eleusis and prove the Threshold right about you: defeat the Frost Giants, unleash the northern winds, and some of the ice gems—the core of the power the giants guard.
DescFinal=The Threshold gave you knowledge. The North gave you strength.
Repetible=0
RequiredLevel=29
PosMap=354
DescAudio=1498
DescFinalAudio=1499

[QUEST173]
Nombre=Lynn's Blood
Desc=If you have the courage to enter the Cave of the Nagas and extract a sample of their Blood, and also bring me a special potion, you will be rewarded with great power.
DescFinal=Great job, with this Flash you'll have incredible power!
Repetible=0
RequiredLevel=31
PosMap=517
DescAudio=1541
DescFinalAudio=1542

[QUEST174]
Nombre=Persistent Pest Control
Desc=In recent days we have received reports of the presence of black rats in the basements of several Patreon Houses. These large, rarely traveled spaces often become ideal refuges for persistent pests. We cannot allow a distinguished property to fall into neglect. Descend into your basement, eliminate any creatures you find, and bring me proof that the situation has been properly controlled.
DescFinal=I see that you have fulfilled your task. The infestation has been reduced and, for the time being, your property is back in proper condition.
Repetible=1
DescAudio=1108
DescFinalAudio=1109

[QUEST175]
Nombre=Anomalous Specimens
Desc=On rare occasions, an unusual specimen appears among the rats in the basement, recognizable by the pale tone of its tail. This is not a common pest, but an anomaly that very few house owners ever see. These specimens are elusive, and their appearance is unpredictable. If you are fortunate and skilled—enough to find one, bring me its tail as proof. The reward will match your effort.
DescFinal=I must admit, few manage to bring me a proof like this. You have shown patience and determination, qualities uncommon even among distinguished house owners. These specimens do not often reveal themselves, so consider this achievement exceptional. Should the anomaly appear again, I trust you will recognize it.
Repetible=1
DescAudio=1110
DescFinalAudio=1112

[QUEST176]
Nombre=Lynn's Blood
Desc=If you have the courage to enter the Cave of the Nagas and extract a sample of their Blood, and also bring me a special potion, you will be rewarded with great power.
DescFinal=Great job, with this Flash you'll have incredible power!
Repetible=0
RequiredLevel=33

